    birthstone: "Ruby, Peridot",
    bestMatch: "Aries, Sagittarius",
    toughestMatch: "Taurus, Scorpio",
    overview: "The Sun illuminates your presence with radiant charisma and creative vitality today. Your optimism is infectious, inspiring optimism in everyone around you.",
