    health: "Your vital energy is high. Engage in activities that bring joy, such as dancing, sports, or creative expression.",
    cosmicAdvice: "Shine your light with generosity, uplifting others as you rise.",
    aboutTitle: "About Leo — The Star of the Zodiac",
    aboutProse: ["Leo is the sign the zodiac built around warmth — quite literally, since it's the only sign ruled by the Sun itself. Fixed Fire gives Leo a steady, radiant kind of confidence: not the quick spark of Aries or the wandering fire of Sagittarius, but a flame that holds, that other people gather around. Leos aren't trying to be the center of attention so much as they simply are, the way the sun is the center of a solar system without needing to try.","Fixed signs commit; Fire signs express. Together, they make Leo one of the zodiac's most loyal, generous, and creatively expressive signs — someone who loves openly, leads naturally, and genuinely wants the people around them to shine too, so long as their own light isn't dimmed in the process."],
    personalityTraits: [{"strength":"Warm, generous, and big-hearted","shadow":"Can be prideful or need constant validation"},{"strength":"Natural leader, commands a room","shadow":"Struggles to admit fault"},{"strength":"Fiercely loyal to loved ones","shadow":"Can dominate conversations without meaning to"},{"strength":"Creative and expressive","shadow":"Sensitive to criticism or being ignored"},{"strength":"Confident and self-assured","shadow":"Prone to drama when feeling unseen"},{"strength":"Encourages others to shine","shadow":"Stubborn once ego is involved"}],
    personalityProse: "Leo's gift is presence — the ability to walk into a room and make people feel like something good is about to happen. The shadow side of that same gift is a real need to be *seen*; when Leo feels overlooked, the confidence that usually reads as magnetic can tip into attention-seeking, and pride can make it hard to simply say \"I was wrong.\"",
    loveProse: ["Leo loves big — grand gestures, generous affection, public pride in a partner. This is a sign that wants a relationship to feel like a genuine celebration, not a quiet arrangement, and Leo brings real warmth, loyalty, and romance to the people it chooses. What Leo needs in return is appreciation; a partner who doesn't notice effort or affection will slowly starve a Leo's confidence, even if the love underneath never wavered."],
    loveWants: "admiration, loyalty, romance with a bit of flair, and a partner who's proud to be seen with them.",
    loveStruggles: "feeling taken for granted, partners who withhold praise, and admitting vulnerability without it feeling like a loss of dignity.",
    compatibilityChart: [{"sign":"Aries","stars":"★★★★★","why":"Two Fire signs matching passion for passion — bold, loud, and loyal together."},{"sign":"Sagittarius","stars":"★★★★★","why":"Shared enthusiasm and love of the grand gesture; rarely a dull relationship."},{"sign":"Gemini","stars":"★★★★☆","why":"Gemini's wit keeps Leo entertained, and Leo's warmth keeps Gemini grounded."},{"sign":"Libra","stars":"★★★★☆","why":"Libra's charm and appreciation for beauty flatters Leo's romantic side."},{"sign":"Leo","stars":"★★★☆☆","why":"Glamorous and generous together, if both learn to share the spotlight."},{"sign":"Aquarius","stars":"★★★☆☆","why":"Opposite signs — magnetic, but Aquarius' detachment can wound Leo's need for warmth."},{"sign":"Cancer","stars":"★★☆☆☆","why":"Leo's need for spotlight can leave sensitive Cancer feeling secondary."},{"sign":"Scorpio","stars":"★★☆☆☆","why":"Two strong wills locked in a quiet battle for control."},{"sign":"Virgo","stars":"★★☆☆☆","why":"Virgo's critical eye can wound Leo's pride faster than intended."},{"sign":"Capricorn","stars":"★★☆☆☆","why":"Both natural leaders, rarely willing to follow the other."},{"sign":"Taurus","stars":"★★☆☆☆","why":"Two Fixed signs, neither budging first — a genuine standoff risk."},{"sign":"Pisces","stars":"★★☆☆☆","why":"Pisces' need for quiet emotional depth doesn't always match Leo's need for expression."}],
    careerProse: ["Leo shines in careers that put its natural charisma and creativity to work: performing arts, entertainment, management, public relations, event planning, entrepreneurship, teaching. This is a sign built for leadership roles — not because Leo needs power for its own sake, but because Leo genuinely enjoys inspiring a team and taking public ownership of a result.","With money, Leo tends toward generosity, sometimes to a fault — treating friends, splurging on quality over quantity, investing in appearance and experience. The upside is that Leo rarely settles for mediocre work and often earns accordingly; the risk is spending in a way that matches the image Leo wants to project rather than what the budget actually allows."],
    healthProse: ["Ruled by the heart and spine, Leo benefits enormously from cardiovascular exercise and posture-focused movement — this is a sign that genuinely feels better standing tall. Leo's health often tracks closely with self-esteem: periods of feeling unseen or unappreciated can manifest physically as fatigue or heart-related stress, more than in most other signs. Creative outlets (performance, art, anything with an audience, even a small one) function as legitimate stress relief for Leo, not just hobbies."],
    genderComparison: [{"category":"In love","man":"Romances boldly, wants a proud partner","woman":"Loves generously, expects the same in return"},{"category":"At work","man":"Natural boss energy, dislikes being micromanaged","woman":"Commands respect without needing to demand it"},{"category":"Under stress","man":"Gets prideful, avoids admitting fault","woman":"Gets dramatic, needs reassurance"},{"category":"Best trait","man":"Magnetic confidence","woman":"Warm, generous leadership"}],
    famousPeople: ["Barack Obama","Jennifer Lopez","Madonna","Chris Hemsworth","Coco Chanel","Whitney Houston","Napoleon Bonaparte"],
    faqs: [{"question":"What does it mean to be a Leo?","answer":"Being a Leo means being ruled by the Sun and Fixed Fire — a combination that produces warm, confident, natural leaders who express themselves openly and love loyally."},{"question":"What is Leo's zodiac element?","answer":"Fire, shared with Aries and Sagittarius — the three signs known for passion, confidence, and enthusiasm."},{"question":"Who should a Leo marry?","answer":"Fellow Fire signs Aries and Sagittarius match Leo's energy and passion most naturally, while Air signs Gemini and Libra bring the charm and admiration Leo appreciates."},{"question":"What is Leo's biggest weakness?","answer":"Pride — Leo's confidence is real, but it can make admitting mistakes or asking for help feel more threatening than it needs to be."},{"question":"Is Leo an arrogant zodiac sign?","answer":"Leo's confidence can be mistaken for arrogance, but it's usually generosity in disguise — most Leos want everyone around them to feel as celebrated as they do, not just themselves."}]
