    aboutTitle: "About Scorpio — The Alchemist of the Zodiac",
    aboutProse: ["Scorpio is the sign the zodiac reserves for intensity. Ruled by both Mars (drive) and Pluto (transformation), and grounded in Fixed Water, Scorpio doesn't do surface-level anything — not conversation, not attraction, not loyalty. This is a sign built to go underneath: past small talk, past first impressions, straight to what's actually true.","Fixed Water is one of the zodiac's most potent combinations — deep feeling (Water) held with unshakable resolve (Fixed). It produces people who feel everything intensely but rarely show it plainly, preferring to observe quietly and decide, often long before anyone else realizes a decision has already been made."],
