    personalityProse: "Scorpio's intensity is often misunderstood as darkness, but it's really depth — this is a sign that simply refuses to fake anything, including emotion. The cost of that depth is real vulnerability, which Scorpio often guards fiercely, sometimes so fiercely that trust becomes hard to earn even from people who deserve it.",
    loveProse: ["Scorpio doesn't do casual — when this sign commits, it's total, and it expects the same intensity in return. There's little interest in surface-level dating; Scorpio wants to know the real person underneath, quickly, and can be unusually perceptive about spotting dishonesty or half-heartedness in a partner. Once trust is genuinely earned, Scorpio is one of the most devoted, protective signs in the zodiac — but that trust has to be earned first, and betrayal (real or perceived) is remembered."],
