    aboutTitle: "About Capricorn — The Achiever of the Zodiac",
    aboutProse: ["Capricorn is the sign the zodiac hands its long game to. Ruled by Saturn, the planet of discipline and time, and grounded in Cardinal Earth, Capricorn initiates through structure — building slowly, deliberately, toward a goal that might take years to reach. Where other signs chase immediate wins, Capricorn is comfortable being patient, because patience, for this sign, is simply the price of something actually lasting.","Cardinal Earth is a formidable pairing — the drive to begin and lead (Cardinal) combined with practicality and endurance (Earth). It produces people who set ambitious goals and then quietly, methodically work toward them, often achieving more than louder signs simply because Capricorn never stops showing up."],
    personalityTraits: [{"strength":"Disciplined and goal-oriented","shadow":"Prone to workaholism"},{"strength":"Responsible, dependable under pressure","shadow":"Can be emotionally guarded or distant"},{"strength":"Ambitious with realistic follow-through","shadow":"Struggles to relax without guilt"},{"strength":"Patient, plays the long game","shadow":"Can be pessimistic or overly cautious"},{"strength":"Financially sensible","shadow":"Slow to trust, slow to open up"},{"strength":"Genuinely loyal once committed","shadow":"Can prioritize achievement over connection"}],
    personalityProse: "Capricorn's discipline is genuinely rare — this is the sign most likely to still be working toward a goal a decade after everyone else gave up. The cost of that focus is often emotional: Capricorn can get so absorbed in building the structure of a life (career, security, reputation) that the softer, more vulnerable parts get deprioritized, sometimes for longer than is healthy.",
    loveProse: ["Capricorn takes love as seriously as it takes everything else — this isn't a sign that dates casually or falls fast. Trust is built slowly, tested quietly, and once given, it's close to unshakeable. Capricorn shows love through reliability and provision more than grand romantic gesture: showing up, following through, building a stable life together. Underneath the reserved exterior is real depth of feeling that Capricorn rarely puts on display, which can make this sign harder to read than it means to be."],
    loveWants: "stability, ambition mirrored in a partner, loyalty proven over time, and enough space to work toward personal goals without guilt.",
    loveStruggles: "vulnerability, expressing emotion openly, and balancing career ambition with genuine presence in the relationship.",
