    aboutTitle: "About Pisces — The Dreamer of the Zodiac",
    aboutProse: ["Pisces closes the zodiac wheel, and it carries something of every sign that came before it — which is part of why this sign feels so hard to pin down. Ruled by Jupiter (expansion) and Neptune (illusion, spirituality), and built on Mutable Water, Pisces is the zodiac's most porous sign: deeply empathetic, intuitive to the point of feeling other people's emotions as its own, and pulled naturally toward art, spirituality, and imagination over cold logic.","Mutable Water is a genuinely fluid combination — adaptability (Mutable) merged with pure feeling (Water). It produces people who absorb the emotional atmosphere of a room without trying to, who often struggle to know where their own feelings end and someone else's begin, and who need real solitude to process and recover from all that absorbed sensitivity."],
