    personalityProse: "Pisces' empathy is the sign's defining gift — few people can sense unspoken pain the way Pisces can. The cost is porous boundaries: without deliberate effort, Pisces can absorb so much of the people around them that they lose track of their own needs, and the same imagination that fuels genuine artistic gift can also become a way of avoiding reality rather than facing it.",
