    careerProse: ["Pisces excels in careers that engage imagination and empathy: art, music, film, therapy, healing professions, spiritual work, nonprofit and humanitarian roles. This is a sign that often struggles in rigidly structured, purely numbers-driven environments, doing far better work when there's room for intuition and creative expression alongside the practical requirements of the job.","With money, Pisces can be genuinely careless — not from irresponsibility, but from simply not prioritizing financial detail the way more Earth-influenced signs do, and from a generous instinct to give that can outpace what the budget actually allows. Automated saving and a trusted second opinion on major financial decisions help Pisces avoid the drift that comes from not paying close attention."],
    healthProse: ["Ruled by the feet, Pisces should pay attention to foot health and circulation, and this sign is also unusually sensitive to its environment — noise, chaos, and overstimulation drain Pisces faster than almost any other sign. Because Pisces absorbs others' emotions so readily, regular solitude isn't optional self-care but a genuine necessity for staying emotionally regulated. Water-based practices (swimming, baths, time near the ocean) and creative or spiritual outlets (art, music, meditation) are especially restorative for this sign specifically."],
